(2) SCANeR Studio Driving Simulation Software: SCANeR Studio is a professional driving simulation software used to simulate road conditions, weather, time, and autonomous vehicle takeover scenarios. A desktop computer is placed to the right of the simulated driving seat, responsible for running the SCANeR Studio driving simulation program (see Figure 1).

